<nav-bar back />
<view class="page backup">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">数据备份</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">训练、饮食、计划和体重都存在手机里，备份到云端后换手机也不会丢。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="dark-card b-card">
    <image class="deco" src="/images/ui/deco-lines.svg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <text class="label-dark">云端备份</text>
    <block wx:if="{{loading}}"><view class="b-state">正在查询…</view></block>
    <block wx:elif="{{cloud}}">
      <view class="b-time num">{{cloud.savedAt}}</view>
      <view class="b-meta num">{{cloud.keyCount}} 项数据 · {{cloud.size}}</view>
    </block>
    <block wx:elif="{{error}}"><view class="b-state">云端状态无法确认</view></block>
    <block wx:else><view class="b-state">还没有云端备份</view></block>
  </view>

  <view class="b-error" wx:if="{{error}}"><image class="icon-sm" src="/images/icons/info-grey.svg" />{{error}}</view>
  <view class="section-link" wx:if="{{error && diagnostic}}" bindtap="copyDiagnostic">复制诊断信息</view>

  <view class="list-card b-local">
    <view class="list-row"><text class="b-label">本机数据</text><text class="b-value num">{{local.keyCount}} 项 · {{local.usedKb}} KB</text></view>
    <view class="list-row"><text class="b-label">本机上次备份</text><text class="b-value num">{{local.lastBackup || '还没有'}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="b-actions">
    <view class="lime-btn {{busy || loading || !available ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="backup"><image class="icon" src="/images/icons/save-ink.svg" />立即备份</view>
    <view class="ghost-btn {{busy || !cloud ? 'b-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="restore">从云端恢复</view>
    <view class="section-link" wx:if="{{error && !loading}}" bindtap="refresh">重新检查云端连接 ↻</view>
  </view>

  <view class="b-note">首次手动备份成功后，离开小程序时若数据有变化、且距上次备份超过 6 小时，会自动备份。备份包含记录和设置，照片本体不包含。</view>
</view>
